OL,11,G0232 Health Check
OL,12,     FThree months since the outbreak
OL,13,     Fwas declared more than 1,900
OL,14,     Fpeople have died from the virus,
OL,15,     Fwith more than 4200 confirmed
OL,16,     Fcases, making this the
OL,17,     Fsecond-worst Ebola outbreak ever.
